<title>USA: TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, California 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Radka Zrubakova (Slovakia) beat Laxmi Pouri (U.S.) 2-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Nathalie Tauziat (France) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) beat Zina Garrison Jackson</p>
<p>(U.S.) 6-4 6-7 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Pam Shriver (U.S.) beat Rennae Stubbs (Australia) 6-2 6-7</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>Paola Suarez (Argentina) beat Yayuk Basuki (India) 6-1 1-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>3-Martina Hingus (Switzerland) beat Anne Miller (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
